{"id":"estilo","lemma":"estilo","pos":"noun","rank":916,"glosses":["style (manner of doing things)","stylus (writing instrument)","stroke (a particular style of swimming)"],"ipa":"/isˈt͡ʃi.lu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/be/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-estilo.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-estilo.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"estilos"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom tem estilo.","en":"Tom has style.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/842002","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},null]},{"text":"Eu gosto do seu estilo.","en":"I like your style.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/493842","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"taste"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Você tem algum estilo particular em mente?","en":"Do you have any particular style in mind?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"some, any"},null,{"g":"private"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"mind"}]},{"text":"Isso é o que chamo de estilo.","en":"Now that's what I call style.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null,null,{"g":"to call","l":"chamar"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"what"]]},{"text":"Vejo que você não perdeu o estilo.","en":"I see you haven't lost your touch.","words":[{"g":"to see","l":"ver"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}